Subject: net: backport NSS ECM hooks to Linux 6.12

Backport kuncy7/openwrt-nss-edma 9caa35b4d718382ad882cb35c2372dbb569de901
patches 0960, 0961, 0963, 0966 and 0966a. Retain the RCU fixes when adding
bridge FDB/VLAN helpers. Adapt the IPv6 route deletion notifier to 6.12.
No Ethernet driver, DSA tagger or switch ownership changes.

Original patches signed off by Julius Bairaktaris <julius@bairaktaris.de>.

